  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Copper Seal mountain has no soil: it is completely formed from all kinds of copper. Mortal level copper such as chaotic sky copper, pragna copper, and snow flower copper makes up most of it, and immortal copper includes profound gray copper and ascending dragon copper. Mortal copper occupies the most space; immortal coppers occupy only a small portion and are mostly rank six immortal materials.",
